Bearer service for external applications 
1.4.2.1 
It shall be possible for applications external to EIRENE to access EIRENE bearer 
services. 
1.4.2.2 
EIRENE will provide the radio bearer for ERTMS/ETCS. The EURORADIO layers are 
responsible for ensuring the overall safety of the transmission link between trainborne 
and trackside ERTMS/ETCS applications. 
